WEBVTT

00:38.645 --> 00:46.591
You wanted power You wanted clean A hollow sound

00:46.671 --> 00:53.875
from a thin machine You tried to tune me out You

00:53.915 --> 00:59.207
tried to change the dial But I've been waiting

00:59.588 --> 01:03.861
all this while

01:05.986 --> 01:11.710
I am the static, I am the noise The signal

01:11.850 --> 01:20.015
breaking, the hidden voice I am the static, the

01:20.175 --> 01:28.840
feedback whale The story that you try to derail

01:39.452 --> 01:46.458
This isn't simple, this isn't grace. This is the

01:46.578 --> 01:53.905
sound of a different place. This is the heart you

01:53.925 --> 02:06.124
tried to hide. The five of us have never died. I am

02:06.144 --> 02:14.330
the static, I am the noise, the signal breaking,

02:14.550 --> 02:21.615
the hidden voice. I am the static, the feedback

02:21.655 --> 02:28.761
whale, the story that you try to derail.

02:36.448 --> 02:37.230
Come on.

03:06.332 --> 03:13.115
I am the static, I am the noise, the signal

03:13.195 --> 03:21.438
breaking, the hidden voice. I am the static, the

03:21.498 --> 03:27.920
feedback whale, the story that you try to

03:27.980 --> 03:38.154
derail. I am the static, I am the static Can you

03:38.194 --> 03:39.075
hear me now?

